  "prefLabel": "Sw 4001.07 Prize Payments",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Sw 4001.07 Prize Payments.\n\n(a) Claims for payment of a winning hot lotto ticket shall be made in accordance with the requirements set forth in Sw 600.\n\n(b) Claims submitted to the lottery commission shall be subject to validation.\n\n(c) The first annuitized jackpot share shall be paid not less than 15 calendar days following the claim.\n\nSource. #6606, eff 10-22-97, rpld by #7403, eff 11-15-00\n\nNew. #7728, eff 7-23-02; ss by #9165, eff 5-31-08",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/sw4000.html"
